    "runtime": "Selected complete combat snapshot fc0881a5c9462c32305a9824d4c83fcdd1d52461 passes the isolated Node 22 full suite: 16432 passed, 81 optional/platform skips, zero failures. 697 selected/public and adjacent checks pass on Node 22 and 24. Public path adds 43 checks for all thirty ranks, source SP, support, E0 token absence and redeployment. All three original 0-1 builds use natural DP and unchanged terrain with Melantha: eleven kills, zero leaks and full life. Final public/HUD/preload full regression remains separate.",
